      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SWIFT WIND (1) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only 0.8 lengths from the winner Magic Snowdrop in third(28.83) at Bulli. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to her credit. Top prospect. ZIPPING LAMBERT (7) was below best last time but prior to that was narrowly beaten when fifth (29.80) in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Can feature with the right run. MISS GLAMOURPUSS (2) continued her winning form with another strong run after running them ragged to bring up four wins on the bounce, scoring at Bulli over 400m (22.29). Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. One of the prime contenders. URBAN BISCUIT (3) will have admirers again after placing at this track and distance last time out.",
